WEBVTT

00:10:29.795 --> 00:10:32.755
in zakaj in kako.

00:10:32.755 --> 00:10:36.154
Kot sem rekla, ko sem jih dopolnila 60,

00:10:36.154 --> 00:10:40.503
ni šlo več za konkretno "Zmoreš?"

00:10:40.503 --> 00:10:43.142
To so vsakdanji mehanizmi.

00:10:43.142 --> 00:10:45.765
To je disciplina in to so priprave

00:10:45.765 --> 00:10:47.642
in v tem je ponos.

00:10:47.642 --> 00:10:52.517
A odločila sem se, da bom mislila,

00:10:52.517 --> 00:10:56.042
izraz je ponavadi segati po zvezdah,

00:10:56.042 --> 00:10:59.118
v mojem primeru pa segam po obzorju.

00:10:59.118 --> 00:11:01.133
In ko dosežeš obzorje,